<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσμαρτ-ῠρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear witness in addition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τούτους εἶναι κληρονόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					6.45
				</span></i>
			; <i>confirm by evidence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ προκλήσει τὴν διαθήκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					45.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταῦτά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. dat., <i>bear additional witness to, confirm</i>
			a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πράγματα -εμαρτύρησε τοῖς λογισμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.89.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.119e
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεμαρτυρεῖτο αὐτῷ ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					288.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.212
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ascribe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα τῷ θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.8.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>to be also in aspect</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Par.Ptol.</u>
				249
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.384
			</span></i>.</div>
